  "id": "failure.payment.not-authorized",
  "title": "PAYMENT fails with PAYMENT_NOT_AUTHORIZED",
  "pattern": "A transaction whose PAYMENT operation fails at apply is still written into the closed ledger: its fee is charged, its sequence number is consumed, and none of its operations change state. The result carries the operation's result code (not_authorized). Readers that skip failed transactions lose the fee and sequence change; readers that assume a failed transaction changed something record effects that never happened.",
